flowchart TD
  Text[Text] --> Tok[Tokenizer]
  Tok --> IDs[Token IDs]
  IDs --> Emb[Token + position embeddings]
  Emb --> L1[Decoder block 1]
  L1 --> L2[Decoder block 2]
  L2 --> LN[Final norm]
  LN --> Unemb[Vocab projection / logits]
  Unemb --> Dec[Decode strategy]
  Dec --> Next[Next token ID]
  Next --> Tok
